sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User
    participant FE as Music App (Frontend)
    participant BE as Backend API
    participant DB as Database

    User->>FE: Selects a song
    FE->>BE: Sends request to select song (SongID)
    BE->>DB: Fetches song details
    DB-->>BE: Returns song data
    BE-->>FE: Sends song confirmation
    
    User->>FE: Selects a playlist
    FE->>BE: Sends request to select playlist (PlaylistID)
    BE->>DB: Fetches playlist details
    DB-->>BE: Returns playlist data
    BE-->>FE: Sends playlist confirmation

    Note over FE, DB: The system adds the song to the playlist
    FE->>BE: Sends request addSongToPlaylist (PlaylistID, SongID)
    BE->>DB: Inserts song into playlist relation
    DB-->>BE: Relation created successfully
    BE-->>FE: Returns success response
    FE-->>User: Displays message "Song added successfully to the playlist"
